AltoNftRewardsAdapter::getBonusRewardInfo
├── when user has no referral nft id set
│   └── it should return zero bonus info
├── when user has referral nft id set to zero
│   └── it should return zero bonus info
├── when referral nft id is owned by caller (self-referral)
│   └── it should return zero bonus info
└── when referral nft id is valid and owned by different user
    ├── when nft owner is valid address
    │   ├── it should return configured bonus discount
    │   ├── it should return configured payment token share
    │   └── it should return nft owner as payment token share receiver
    ├── when nft is burned after referral set
    │   ├── it should return configured bonus discount
    │   ├── it should return configured payment token share
    │   └── it should return address(0) as payment token share receiver
    ├── when multiple users have same referral nft
    │   ├── it should return same bonus info for all users
    │   └── it should return same nft owner as receiver
    ├── when adapter configuration changes after referral set
    │   ├── it should return updated bonus discount
    │   ├── it should return updated payment token share
    │   └── it should return same nft owner as receiver
    ├── when nft is transferred after referral set
    │   ├── it should return new owner as payment token share receiver
    │   ├── it should return configured bonus discount
    │   └── it should return configured payment token share
    └── when calling for different users
        ├── it should return appropriate bonus info for each user
        └── it should maintain independent states
